obj_id: agentGenerated_SouthRegionSalesRiskAnalysis-33817525
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_South Region Sales Risk Analysis
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 7bcd997d-096a-44b3-9f6d-61fc213d1c0f
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • South region ranks dead last in total sales (391,722) vs other regions, 46% behind West leader
        • 2024 profit collapsed 50% despite 31% sales growth - margin fell from 18.9% to 7.2%
        • October consistently generates net losses (-1,676 profit on 24,202 sales)
        • Furniture category shows poor margins with high discount rates eroding profitability

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate 2024 cost structure changes causing margin erosion despite sales growth
        • Develop targeted October turnaround strategy to eliminate seasonal losses
        • Reduce furniture discounting and focus on higher-margin categories
